{"id":"n86694-1-21","stage":4,"title":"호응 · 呼应","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86694-1-21-1","ko":"관객의 반응은 어떤가요?","zh":"观众的反馈怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"관객의","meaning":"观众","explanation":"관객：观众；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"관객","audio":"/audio/c7ab8ce28a53cfd09826.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21886","senseId":"1","lemma":"관객","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관객의","audio":"/audio/121f6fc23da8fecbb04d.mp3"}},{"text":"반응은","meaning":"反应","explanation":"반응：反应；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"반응","audio":"/audio/791889c5b68580a48bb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15850","senseId":"1","lemma":"반응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반응은","audio":"/audio/32a2b06e3eeda9612713.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤가요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤가요","audio":"/audio/23fa3a0906f95e00f157.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c7ab8ce28a53cfd0","term":"관객","zh":"观众","audio":"/audio/c7ab8ce28a53cfd09826.mp3","entryId":"21886","definition":"观看运动比赛、电影、戏剧、音乐会、舞蹈演出等的人。","pronunciation":["관객"]},{"id":"791889c5b68580a4","term":"반응","zh":"反应","audio":"/audio/791889c5b68580a48bb2.mp3","entryId":"15850","definition":"对某种刺激表现出一定的动作或态度；或指那种动作或态度。","pronunciation":["바ː능"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/581b6d1bdc706128e16c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86694-1-21-2","ko":"공연은 대성공이야! 다들 큰 호응을 보이고 있어.","zh":"演出非常成功！大家都反应热烈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공연은","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공연은","audio":"/audio/592aa88f99ff629256aa.mp3"}},{"text":"대성공이야!","meaning":"巨大成功，大获成功","explanation":"대성공：巨大成功，大获成功；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"대성공","audio":"/audio/d9ebe0c031d758d6420f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"39647","senseId":"1","lemma":"대성공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대성공이야","audio":"/audio/b88e9158abcbdad9cd9a.mp3"}},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다들","audio":"/audio/95e0c9a40303ff931c0d.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"호응을","meaning":"呼应，响应","explanation":"호응：呼应，响应；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"호응","audio":"/audio/4e5e772de988c02b78be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86694","senseId":"1","lemma":"호응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"호응을","audio":"/audio/9639b8d2401693f471aa.mp3"}},{"text":"보이고","meaning":"显露，露出","explanation":"보이다：显露，露出；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"2","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이고","audio":"/audio/683be65ef5399a6b3144.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"d9ebe0c031d758d6","term":"대성공","zh":"巨大成功，大获成功","audio":"/audio/d9ebe0c031d758d6420f.mp3","entryId":"39647","definition":"非常令人满意的大成功。","pronunciation":["대ː성공"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"4e5e772de988c02b","term":"호응","zh":"呼应，响应","audio":"/audio/4e5e772de988c02b78be.mp3","entryId":"86694","definition":"回答对方的呼叫或问询，或应其要求行动。","pronunciation":["호응"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"显露，露出","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"观察对象而了解其内容或状态。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e18abf65edc59a0d30f3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86694","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["演出非常成功！大家都反应热烈。","为什么和承奎闹翻了呢？","观众的反馈怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["演出非常成功！大家都反应热烈。","观众的反馈怎么样？","为什么和承奎闹翻了呢？"],"answer":0}]}
